Alder Street — Crayon Case demo film (a fictional case: no real people, places or events)

Story, drawings, animation, aged-paper / crayon / stain / eraser rendering, score and sound design:
  original, procedural code in this folder (frame.js, film.js, looks.js, audio.py).
Music: original. Music box, drone and low note synthesized in audio.py (numpy); no samples.
Foley: synthesized in audio.py (crayon, eraser, stain, room tone, clock); no samples.
Voice: none. Subtitles: none (burned in later by the channel).

Fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1, licence notes in fonts/):
  Freesentation 4 Regular, Freesentation 6 SemiBold — supplied by the user (titles; subtitles later)
  Gaegu Bold — JIKJI SOFT (used only for the base-style comparison frame)

